What this covers
----------------

  data/            scored results (HANDOFF.json)
  analysis/        derived analysis outputs
  adjudication/    judge runs, blinded items, panel protocol and ratings
  docs/            protocol, pre-registration record, deviations, manifest
  frameworks/      the two framework representations under test
  traps/           the trap suite
  perturbations/   the E2 perturbation and null-control design

Source code in this repository, principally harness/, figures/,
verify_numbers.py and audit_staleness.py, is licensed under the Apache
License 2.0 instead. See LICENSE and NOTICE.


What this does not cover
------------------------

The biomedical knowledge graph the study runs against is a third-party
production system. It is neither owned nor redistributed by the authors, and
nothing here grants any right to it. What is released is the queries issued
against it, the bindings extracted from those queries, and the agent-free
reference composites.

Third-party model outputs recorded in adjudication/ and analysis/ were
produced by commercial language models under their respective providers'
terms.


